==Description==
'''Easter Bunny Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 36 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{Bunz|1,280}} or {{Robux|147}}. The total cost was {{Bunz|21,540}} or {{Robux|3,692}}.

==Appearance==
'''Easter Bunny Charm''' showcases an Easter bunny sitting down while it has various vegetables like carrots next to it. It plays a sound of a bunny jumping when placed down.

The color of the '''Easter Bunny Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is purple in its preview in the inventory.

